# Internal engineering notes: design rationale, the log of what was tried
# and reverted, and talk material. Kept local on purpose — the public repo
# documents what HyperBox does, not the story of building it.
#
# `internal/*` rather than `internal/`, because git cannot re-include a file
# whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded -- excluding the contents instead leaves
# the directory walkable so the negation below can take effect.
internal/*
# ...except the decision log. The rest of internal/ is working notes; this one
# is the record of what was decided and why, and a record only one machine can
# see is not a record.
!internal/decisions.md
